{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Build a Voice Assistant Pipeline \u2014 The Phase 6 Capstone Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: mic capture with chunking (pseudocode)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import sounddevice as sd"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def mic_stream(chunk_ms=20, sr=16000):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    q = queue.Queue()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def cb(indata, frames, time, status):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        q.put(indata.copy().flatten())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    with sd.InputStream(channels=1, samplerate=sr, blocksize=int(sr * chunk_ms/1000), callback=cb):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        while True:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            yield q.get()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: VAD-gated turn capture"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def capture_turn(stream, vad, pre_roll_ms=300, silence_ms=500):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    buf, pre, triggered = [], collections.deque(maxlen=pre_roll_ms // 20), False"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    silent = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for chunk in stream:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        pre.append(chunk)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if vad(chunk):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if not triggered:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                buf = list(pre)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                triggered = True"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            buf.append(chunk)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            silent = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        elif triggered:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            silent += 20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            buf.append(chunk)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if silent >= silence_ms:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                return b\"\".join(buf)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: streaming STT \u2192 LLM \u2192 TTS"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "async def turn(audio_bytes):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    transcript = await stt.transcribe(audio_bytes)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    async for token in llm.stream(transcript):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        async for audio in tts.stream(token):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            await speaker.play(audio)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: tool calling inside the LLM loop"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "tools = ["
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    {\"name\": \"get_weather\", \"parameters\": {\"location\": \"string\"}},"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    {\"name\": \"set_timer\", \"parameters\": {\"seconds\": \"int\"}},"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "async for chunk in llm.stream(user_text, tools=tools):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if chunk.type == \"tool_call\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        result = dispatch(chunk.name, chunk.args)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        continue_streaming(result)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if chunk.type == \"text\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        await tts.stream(chunk.text)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 5: interruption handling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "tts_task = asyncio.create_task(tts_loop())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "while True:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    chunk = await mic.get()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if vad(chunk):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        tts_task.cancel()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        await speaker.stop()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        await new_turn()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        break"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. **Easy.** Run `code/main.py`. It simulates one full turn end-to-end with stub modules and prints per-stage latency.\n2. **Medium.** Replace the STT stub with a real Whisper model on a pre-recorded `.wav`. Measure WER and end-to-end latency.\n3. **Hard.** Add tool calling: implement `get_weather` (any API) and `set_timer`. Route the LLM through the tools and verify that when the user says \"set a 5 minute timer\" the right function fires and the spoken reply confirms it."
      ]
    }
